#!fsharp

// The kernel runs this file after `#r "nuget: Quiver.Interactive"` resolves the package.
//
// It is an F# cell regardless of the notebook's own language: a `.dib` cell names its kernel, so
// this registers Quiver's formatters just as well in a C# or PowerShell notebook.
//
// Deliberately one call and nothing else. Anything that fails in here fails during a `#r`, where
// the error is attributed to the package reference rather than to the line that caused it, so
// this file's only job is to name a function that is tested elsewhere.
Quiver.Formatters.register ()

#!markdown

**Quiver** is loaded. A `Figure` now displays inline as SVG, and so do `Node`, `Color`, `Ramp`,
`Color[]`, `Dim`, `U<'u>` and `IScaleErased`.

Change the inline figure size with `Quiver.Formatters.registerWith (Quiver.Chart.size 1000.0 620.0)`.
